# cstringBeginsWithPrefix("Hello", "Hello, World") == 0 (prefix longer than string)
call beginsLongerCall cstringBeginsWithPrefix
argument beginsLongerCall s CNullTerminatedByteString hello
argument beginsLongerCall prefix CNullTerminatedByteString helloFull
run beginsLongerCall
bind ok beginsLongerRes CSignedInt32 beginsLongerCall
call beginsLongerCheckCall math.equalI64
argument beginsLongerCheckCall left I64 beginsLongerRes
argument beginsLongerCheckCall right I64 zeroI32trueChk
