# cstringEndsWithSuffix("Hello, World", "Hello") == 0 (matches prefix, not suffix)
call endsMismatchCall cstringEndsWithSuffix
argument endsMismatchCall s CNullTerminatedByteString helloComma
argument endsMismatchCall suffix CNullTerminatedByteString hello
run endsMismatchCall
bind ok endsMismatchRes CSignedInt32 endsMismatchCall
call endsMismatchCheckCall math.equalI64
argument endsMismatchCheckCall left I64 endsMismatchRes
argument endsMismatchCheckCall right I64 zeroI32trueChk
run endsMismatchCheckCall
bind value endsMismatchOk Bool endsMismatchCheckCall
branch if condition endsMismatchOk target endsMismatchOkLabel
branch else target testFailed
